      "message": "Since GDB support is not yet implemented, I\u0027ll leave it as is. Python\u0027s `argparse` module allows you to specify the options either with an equals sign and no spaces (useful for clarity or when there are special characters in the value), or with space deliniation. All chromite tooling behaves like this, since it all uses `argparse`.",
